{"id":3,"role":"Assistant","content":"","timestamp":1786321703,"token_count":0,"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"task_items\":[{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-06 through 2026-08-08 sessions 38-60): Lüscher roadmap steps 1-4, character expansion infrastructure, cascade lemmas, topology analysis. See completed items 93-111 for details.\",\"id\":\"90\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-08 session 61): BREAKTHROUGH ANALYSIS (§8.11.51). Claimed axiom is FALSE without gauge invariance. Added gauge invariance hypothesis in session 62.\",\"id\":\"112\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-09 session 62): GAUGE INVARIANCE INFRASTRUCTURE IMPLEMENTED. Added hf_gauge : IsGaugeInvariant N f to transferMatrixPositivity_axiom.\",\"id\":\"113\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-09 session 64): FIXED BUILD + KEY LEMMA PROVEN + CRITICAL GAP ANALYSIS (§8.11.52). gaugeInvariant_matrixElement_integral_zero PROVEN. §8.11.51 'trivial rep only' approach WRONG for L≥2.\",\"id\":\"114\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-09 session 65): RESOLVED the gauge invariance question — the hypothesis is NOT needed and has been REMOVED. KEY FINDINGS (§8.11.53): (1) §8.11.51 counterexample is INVALID. (2) Correct mechanism is PD of plaquette factor. (3) β=0 case provably ≥0. (4) σ twist ALREADY disappears. (5) A_{w*} ≠ conj(A_w) in general. (6) CORRECT formalization path uses interface_kernel_character_expansion. REMOVED hf_gauge from axiom + all 5 downstream sites. Build GREEN, 0 sorries, 6 axioms.\",\"id\":\"115\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-09 session 66): DISCOVERED that step 1 of the formalization path is ALREADY COMPLETE. The infrastructure connecting abstract character expansion to concrete lattice is fully proven.\",\"id\":\"116\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-09 session 67): STEP 2 COMPLETE. osG_thetaG_eq_char_expansion_pointwise PROVEN. Build GREEN, 0 sorries, 6 axioms. See §8.11.54.\",\"id\":\"117\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-09 session 68): STEP 4 BUILDING BLOCK. New lemma integral_repCharacter_trivial PROVEN: ∫ χ_s(g) dμ = δ_{s,σ_0}. Build GREEN, 0 sorries, 6 axioms. See §8.11.55.\",\"id\":\"118\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-09 session 69): STEP 4 COMPLETE. New lemma integral_prod_repCharacter_trivial PROVEN: multi-link temporal collapse. Build GREEN, 0 sorries, 6 axioms. Deeper step 3 analysis (§8.11.56): confirmed the infinite expansion obstacle is FUNDAMENTAL.\",\"id\":\"119\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-09 session 70): STEP 3 KEY INGREDIENT COMPLETE. Extended peterWeyl_clebschGordan_plaquette axiom with Part 3 (Schur orthogonality for countable Λ) + Part 4 (CG decomposition for ι×Λ with finite Finset support). New lemma triple_product_character_matrix_integral_Λ PROVEN. Build GREEN, 0 sorries, 6 axioms. Axiom strengthened #7.\",\"id\":\"120\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-09 session 71): LOGGED AXIOM STRENGTHENING #7 in axiom_growth_audit.md §7 + README.md axiom table/audit summary. Added §8.11.57 to design doc. CRITICAL FINDING (§8.11.58): The triple-product matrix M is NOT PSD (U(1) counterexample). The step 5 approach (triple product → PSD Gram → ≥0) does NOT work. Build GREEN, 0 sorries, 6 axioms. No code changes — analysis only.\",\"id\":\"121\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"DONE (2026-08-09 session 72): DECIDED the revised approach after §8.11.58. The gauge invariance hypothesis is NOT needed — the §8.11.53 resolution is CORRECT. The axiom is TRUE for all f (by Osterwalder-Seiler reflection positivity). The step 5 approach failed because it did NOT perform the change of variables V⁺ → W⁺ = θV⁺. The CORRECT proof uses: (1) change of variables V⁺ → W⁺ = θV⁺ (measure-preserving, resolves S_pos/S_neg asymmetry), (2) PD of interface kernel (gives ∫ H·conj(H)·K ≥ 0 for each u⁰), (3) integrate over u⁰. All key infrastructure already PROVEN: reflectLinkVariable_measurePreserving_between (LatticeMeasure.lean:520), neg_action_reflection_os_periodic (ReflectionPositivity.lean:2333), interface_action_reflection_symmetric_os_periodic (ReflectionPositivity.lean:2379), plaquetteBoltzmannPD (PeterWeyl.lean:367), interface_kernel_character_expansion (PeterWeyl.lean:1635). Documented in §8.11.59. Build GREEN, 0 sorries, 6 axioms. No code changes — decision + proof strategy documentation only.\",\"id\":\"122\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"PENDING — NEW PLAN (§8.11.59): Close transferMatrixPositivity_axiom (axiom count 6→5) via the reflection positivity / change-of-variables approach. The proof strategy: (1) Start from ∫ osG(U)·osG(θU) dμ = ∫ f(U)·f(θU)·exp(-β S(U)) dμ (already shown). (2) Decompose exp(-β S) = exp(-β S_pos)·exp(-β S_neg)·exp(-β S_int). (3) Change of variables V⁺ → W⁺ = θV⁺ (reflectLinkVariable_measurePreserving_between), transforming S_neg(V⁺)→S_pos(W⁺) (neg_action_reflection_os_periodic), S_int→S_int(U⁺,u⁰,θW⁺) (interface_action_reflection_symmetric_os_periodic), f(θU)→f(W⁺,u⁰_s). (4) Apply PD of interface kernel K(U⁺,W⁺)=exp(-β S_int(U⁺,u⁰,θW⁺)) (plaquetteBoltzmannPD + interface_kernel_character_expansion), giving ∫ H·conj(H)·K ≥ 0 for each u⁰. (5) Integrate over u⁰. REMAINING: (A) Apply change of variables at the FULL integral level (split product Haar measure into dμ⁺ dμ⁰ dμ⁻, apply reflectLinkVariable_measurePreserving_between to dμ⁻). (B) State and apply PD of interface kernel in the right form (kernel on U⁺ vs W⁺). (C) Verify f(θU) = f(W⁺, u⁰_s) using dependsOnlyOnPosSpatialInterface. (D) Convert transferMatrixPositivity_axiom to lemma (axiom count 6→5). NOTE: axiom lacks hN : 1 ≤ N but character expansion requires it — N=0 case needs separate argument or hN must be added. Key existing infra: reflectLinkVariable_measurePreserving_between (LatticeMeasure.lean:520), neg_action_reflection_os_periodic (ReflectionPositivity.lean:2333), interface_action_reflection_symmetric_os_periodic (ReflectionPositivity.lean:2379), plaquetteBoltzmannPD (PeterWeyl.lean:367), interface_kernel_character_expansion (PeterWeyl.lean:1635), osG_thetaG_eq_char_expansion_pointwise (ReflectionPositivity.lean:2818), transferMatrix_change_of_variables (TransferMatrix.lean:2619 — existing pattern for the change of variables).\",\"id\":\"48\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"pending\"}]}","name":"project_task_list"},"id":"1e9c37e4-65cd-44b9-94b6-cb8405e32829","type":"function"}],"full_token_estimate":1352,"turn":0,"is_prune_marker":false}
